23:["$","p","18",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The best freelance writer invoice format is simple and specific. It should not be crowded, but it must answer the client’s main questions: who is billing, what work was completed, what amount is due and when payment should be made."}]]}]
